sequenceDiagram
    %% a share link for a review
    actor owner as Owner
    actor guest as Guest
    participant rest as REST API
    participant identity as Identity
    participant ws as Co-editing socket
    owner->>rest: create a share link
    rest->>identity: mint the capability
    identity-->>rest: link
    rest-->>owner: link
    owner-)guest: sends the link
    guest->>rest: open the link
    rest->>identity: check it
    alt link is still valid
        identity-->>rest: fine
        rest-->>guest: page
        guest->>ws: join
        ws-->>guest: state
    else expired
        identity-->>rest: expired
        rest--xguest: 410
    end
    Note over guest,ws: a guest sees only this one engram
